id: cor-q-is-meager-and-not-g-delta
kind: corollary
title: "$\\mathbb{Q}$ is $F_\\sigma$, meager and not $G_\\delta$, while the irrationals are $G_\\delta$, residual and not $F_\\sigma$"
status: published
