research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-beta-topology-uniform-apply.result.json:16:  "tail": "Batch A1/A2/A4 is complete for all 61 topology-uniform items.\n\n- Classified 19 exact-source, 21 semantic-source, and 21 established-knowledge items.\n- Applied 40 approved provenance tags; 21 remain untagged pending Alpha concurrence.\n- Applied 15 material repairs covering 11 empty-carrier defects and eight citation-precision defects.\n- Preserved every A3-declined change.\n- Removed stale judge/audit stamps from all material repairs.\n- Verified all 180 proof steps and 188 citations.\n- Strict proof contracts pass 45/45; precheck, rendercheck, citecheck, prosecheck, depcheck, fwdcheck, extcheck, and depsource pass.\n- The full content-policy gate remains intentionally red only for the 21 Alpha-deferred rows.\n\nA3’s proposed `ex-discrete-metric` dependency proved to be an illegal B-page edge. The final repair verifies the zero-one metric directly and cites legal A-page targets.\n\nHandoff artifacts:\n\n- [Findings and A4 repair record](/home/lazyinspirit/Projects/prestige-math-library/research/audit/wave7-topology-uniform.findings.md)\n- [Provenance ledger](/home/lazyinspirit/Projects/prestige-math-library/research/audit/wave7-topology-uniform.provenance.jsonl)\n- [Proof contracts](/home/lazyinspirit/Projects/prestige-math-library/research/audit/wave7-topology-uniform.proof-contracts.json)\n\nAlpha must adjudicate the 21 established-knowledge rows and certify the 15 material repairs. The orchestrator still owns the serial whole-wave `post-A4` snapshot and impact-audit generation. The findings also disclose an accidental duplicate `pre-A4` stage label; all 15 required item-specific baselines are present and valid."
